think Measurement over memory: crop_gesture.rye already stands (preview extracts a sub-rectangle), and the whole Photos gesture family (crop, flip_h, flip_v, rotate_quarter, scale, adjust) is already whole -- the card and the newest log were a step behind. So neither crop nor flip/rotate is the gap.
think The genuine floor gap: no blur or convolution primitive exists in any of the 115 image modules. By Lindy-first crux-first a separable box blur is the strongest pick -- convolution is the durable floor the whole soft-image family stands on (drop shadow, frosted panel, Gaussian, sharpen, edge kernels all descend from it), and a box blur is the hardest solvable rung that opens that family, a clean one-lap integer running-sum.
think Design: a separable box mean of radius r -- the 2D (2r+1)x(2r+1) window is two 1D passes (horizontal then vertical on that result), matching image/scale_area.rye's own direct-gather idiom with a named radius bound rather than a running sum. Integer-only, half-up rounding (bias r over the odd window 2r+1), clamp-to-edge so the window stays full and a solid stays solid at its edges. Owns the box mean, leans only on qoi for the grid -- no blend, no codec, no color math. box_blur_h and box_blur_v exposed for a directional (motion) blur; box_blur their composition, freeing its row-blurred intermediate before return.
obs One honest fix on the first metal run: a box blur spreads a point into a FLAT-TOP plateau, not a peak, so the center equals its orthogonal neighbors (28 each for a lit dot). My CenterNotBrightest check assumed a Gaussian peak; corrected it to prove the flat plateau (center positive AND equal to its neighbor) -- a more honest and educational check, the box signature. The GREEN print line and README were kept in sync with the corrected claim.
obs TAME flagged seven compound asserts (assert(a and b)); split each into named halves so the failing half is always named. TAME + width + ASCII + living-docs + living-card ASCII all GREEN after.
loom witness=blur_witness wall_pass=GREEN modules=1 checks=13 radius_max=256
