recommend keep-going -- blur is the convolution floor; Gaussian (box mean run a few times), sharpen (image minus its own blur), and edge kernels are now its siblings to grow, while the Microkernel double-seat's only ungated move stays study. Council rota this lap: the Standfast foundation (item 5).
